Examples of **incorrect** code for this rule:

```vue
<script>
export default {
  watch: {
    foo: () => {},
    bar: {
      handler: () => {},
    },
    baz: [
      (val) => {},
      {
        handler: () => {},
      },
    ],
  },
};
</script>
```

Examples of **correct** code for this rule:

```vue
<script>
export default {
  watch: {
    foo() {},
    bar: function () {},
    baz: {
      handler: function () {},
    },
  },
};
