```javascript
test("with assertion count", () => {
  expect.assertions(1);
  expect(true).toBe(true);
});
test("with hasAssertions", () => {
  expect.hasAssertions();
  expect(true).toBe(true);
});
```

///Examples of **incorrect** code with `{ "onlyFunctionsWithAsyncKeyword": true }`:

