// Below a describe block
describe("test suite", () => {});
test("my test", () => {});

// Same for hooks
beforeAll("my beforeAll", () => {});
describe("test suite", () => {});
afterEach("my afterEach", () => {});
```

Examples of **correct** code for this rule:

```javascript
