```jsx
var Hello = createReactClass({
  componentWillUpdate: function () {
    this.setState({
      name: this.props.name.toUpperCase(),
    });
  },
  render: function () {
    return <div>Hello {this.state.name}</div>;
  },
});
```

Examples of **correct** code for this rule:

```jsx
