Foo.prototype.bar = function bar() {};
(function bar() {
  /* ... */
})();
```

Examples of **correct** code for this rule with the `"never"` option:

```js
/* func-names: ["error", "never"] */

Foo.prototype.bar = function () {};
(function () {
  /* ... */
})();
