## Configuration

### The 1st option

type: `"always" | "smart"`

#### `"always"`

Always require triple-equal comparisons, `===`/`!==`.
This is the default.

#### `"smart"`

Allow certain safe comparisons to use `==`/`!=` (`typeof`, literals, nullish).

