| xPermittedCrossDomainPolicies   | [X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies)               | none                                                                       | True       |
