expected and these helpers are no longer needed.

### Examples

Examples of **incorrect** code for this rule:

```vue
<script>
export default {
  mounted() {
    this.$set(obj, key, value);
    this.$delete(obj, key);
    Vue.set(obj, key, value);
    Vue.delete(obj, key);
  },
};
</script>
```

Examples of **correct** code for this rule:

```vue
<script>
export default {
  mounted() {
    obj[key] = value;
    delete obj[key];
  },
};
</script>
```

