| apps/1000  | 497.6 ms                          | 431.1 ms                              | 66.5 ms    | 1.15x   |
| apps/5000  | 1.100 s                           | 894.5 ms                              | 205.5 ms   | 1.23x   |
| apps/10000 | 1.814 s                           | 1.368 s                               | 446.0 ms   | 1.33x   |

